  npcName: Zorb
  Lines:
  - Hey, kid! I see that ship is all fixed up
  - 'Looks great! '
  - What?! Leaving already? Cmon, atleast come chat to the folks at the festival
    for a bit!
  - I hate to say it, but you've really made an impact on our little planet!
  - Go enjoy the festival. When you're ready to head home, come chat to me
  - You ready to head home, kid?
  - I can't blame you! The festival is amazing this year. Come chat to me when you're
    ready to go!
  - Alrighty then. I must say, I'm gonna miss you and that darn ship of yours!
  - Even if I still have to fix the communication pole now...
  - Cmon then kid, lets get you home.
